    "description": "Educational reference description for IGF-1 LR3.",
    "sourceString": "IGF-1 LR3 is a modified insulin-like growth factor-1 analogue with amino-acid substitutions that reduce binding-protein affinity and extend activity. It is discussed mostly in advanced performance and cell-growth research contexts.",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational reference description for IGF-1 LR3."
